# D3-AN-007: Triangulate a solvent identity from independent physical properties
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 ethanol 10g
add v2 isopropanol 10g
add v3 propanone 10g
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
measure v3 density
measure v1 boiling_point
measure v2 boiling_point
measure v3 boiling_point
measure v1 melting_point
measure v2 melting_point
measure v3 melting_point
inspect
